do
---A furnace. Normal furnaces only process "smelting" category recipes, but you can make furnaces that process other [recipe categories](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RecipeCategory.html).
---
---The difference to assembling machines is that furnaces automatically choose their recipe based on input. See [Furnace Recipe Selection](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/furnace-recipe-selection.html) for how the recipe is chosen.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/FurnacePrototype.html)
---@class (exact) FurnacePrototype:CraftingMachinePrototype
---@
